{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07895","headline":"与崔二十一游镜湖寄包贺二公 · 孟浩然","name":"与崔二十一游镜湖寄包贺二公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"试览镜湖物，中流到底清。\n不知鲈鱼味，但识鸥鸟情。\n帆得樵风送，春逢谷雨晴。\n将探夏禹穴，稍背越王城。\n府掾有包子，文章推贺生。\n沧浪醉後唱，因此寄同声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}